A2 L2: a colonist on a 4 m west ledge beside a 7 m core, asked for the east ledge across a sunken steel deck at ledge height: RelativeVeto=False, CanReach True, A* found standing on >= 2 deck squares, deck view, CanReach == found; the control up the wall reads a veto (ProofReach)
